Description: ota.c takes its staging area, boot tag, USB id, boot name and decode buffer from the build; the boot-installer path can be switched off
 Wraps OTA_AREA/OTA_AREA_LEN in #ifndef; adds #ifndef hooks OTA_BOOT_TAG
 (default "FELUCCA-LOADER-1", used in two places), OTA_USB_ID (default
 "ota-FM-1_015"), OTA_BOOT_NAME (default "LOADER.BIN", the JLFS filename
 written to the OTA flash slot and validated on read-back) and OTA_DEC_DEFINED
 (skips scratch.h and the ota_dec alias so the build supplies
 ota_dec[OTA_FRAME_MAX]). Adds OTA_BOOT_INSTALLER (default 1): with 0 the
 ota_sha256.h include, the pinned m-bootloader v1.2 installer branch (boot,
 hash, expected SHA-256) are compiled out and a package without flash.bin is
 refused with -3. Hooks only: with none of the macros set the compiled code
 is the same as upstream's.
Approved-by: Dmitry Kireev, 2026-11-24
Forwarded: no
Applies-to: keremimo/melodee v1.6.1 (165d177a425944f3d30b0b669255a6ed0050c3a5)
---
